# Bot1 takes Bot2's Guerrilla Gorilla with Claim the Firstborn, then exiles it with 70,000 Light-Years from Home: "its
# controller" is the player who controlled it as it was exiled (CR 608.2h), Bot1, not its owner Bot2. Bot1 is asked,
# accepts and puts a Plains into its own hand; Bot2's hand and library are untouched.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mountain
Plains
Claim the Firstborn
70,000 Light-Years from Home
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Forest
Guerrilla Gorilla
Swamp x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Guerrilla Gorilla.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest#2.Activate
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Claim the Firstborn.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Guerrilla Gorilla)
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.70,000 Light-Years from Home.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Guerrilla Gorilla)
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Search(Plains)

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Exile = Guerrilla Gorilla
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Bot1.Library.Count = 10
Bot2.Hand.Count = 6
Bot2.Library.Count = 8
